Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:23.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:37.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（戴尔·阿诺食品 水果蔬菜罐头）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.23,0:25:05.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如何把丰收带回家）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:52.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿拉斯加州）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.75,0:28:17.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（陷阱 坏人会来 别停留）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.41,0:37:00.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（抱歉 我是个混蛋 去华盛顿吧 新世界需要瑞克·格兰姆斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can lower that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,W代表着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the W for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的第一批移民\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the first settlers here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们悬赏狼头\N{\fnArial\fs30}they put bounties on wolves' heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,找了印第安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought the natives into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们猎狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made them hunt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多久 狼就被杀光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't take them too long to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼现在回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天道好轮回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything gets a return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在耍嘴皮吗？- 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you shitting me? - No, I shit you not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么机会见到新面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get to meet new people very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概每两周一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe once every two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真多 - 我很努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a lot. - Oh, I work at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我们找到营地 掳掠一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we find camps. We run through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们也会设陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have traps, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不一样 不是这样的见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different. It's not like meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,平等地见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}As equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火堆前跟陌生人聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little chats in front of a fire with a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是如今最像电影的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the closest thing to movies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想念电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前… 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to… put that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能留一点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I keep a little of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我挺过一两天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to get me through a day or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just to keep me alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要带走你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不会活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not exactly gonna be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近的一些印第安人部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the tribes around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为第一批人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}they thought that the first people were wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由狼变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}transformed into men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天道好轮回 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything gets a return, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的补给和装备可以全归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have my supplies. You can have everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要搞得太丑恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't need to be any ugliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能允许你带走我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't allow you to take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should just go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:08:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,整晚都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}All night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就跟在车厢里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's like the train car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了这么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the whole thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还被关在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安娜想让你来这里 冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna wanted you in here, calm things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔处理了你的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita patched you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔来了一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl came by for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让皮特待在另一座房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put Pete in another house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以告诉我家暴的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have told me what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情进展迅速 然后出了诺亚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It moved fast. And then Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能跟你说枪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't tell you about the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you wanted this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找个安身之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to stop being out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说了你不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just said you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里弄到的枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从武器库里拿的？对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took it, right? From the armory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真愚蠢 你为什么要这样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was stupid. Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安娜打算今晚开个会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna's planning to have a meeting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去的人都能参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}For anyone who wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了流放瑞克吗？- 她会提议的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To kick Rick out? - To try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬现在和迪安娜在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's with Deanna right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会搞清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在会议上 你要说你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the meeting, you say you were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人遭受虐待\N{\fnArial\fs30}about someone being abused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大家都坐视不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one was doing anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要说你拿了枪是为了保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you took a gun just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个袭击你的人不会伤害杰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Jessie was safe from a man who wound up attacking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会听他们处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you'll do whatever you want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,编一个他们想听的故事就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them a story that they want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里之后就一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've been doing since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些人是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because these people are children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子喜欢故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and children like stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说尽好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens after all the nice words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还想赶走他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they still try to kick him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.33,0:11:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在派人看守武器库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're guarding the armory now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付他们刀就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all we'll need against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在会议上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tonight at the meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it looks like it's going bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就吹口哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔抓住迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol grabs Deanna,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿下斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take Spencer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you grab Reg,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦和亚伯拉罕掩护我们 控制人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn and Abraham cover us, watch the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以和他们谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't get through,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就抓三个他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take the three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们会割他们的喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say we'll slit their throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在终点站那样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like at Terminus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们只是说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we just tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把武器给我们 那就结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give us the armory and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想这样做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就到了这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 恕我失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再去睡一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna sleep some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 她在门廊上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, hey. She's out on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈什么 玛姬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need to talk about, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meeting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 假如我们可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, if we could talk…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和所有人讨论发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to everyone about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我们要对此采取什么措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what we need to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括流放瑞克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it includes sending Rick away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不会管用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让瑞克进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let Rick in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们所有人进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let all of us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们谈过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定让我们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今你却想要将决定权\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you want to put that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,交到一群极度惊恐\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a group of very frightened people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不清楚来龙去脉的人手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}who might not have the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是领袖该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚只是一次讨论会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight is just a forum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家说说自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just for people to say their piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终将由我来做出决定 一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll make the decision as I've done since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时是触景生情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所看见的 他所失去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things he's seen. The things he's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大家失去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things we have all lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们失去的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things you've lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去的远比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克拿走了一把枪 并且用枪指着人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick took a gun and he pointed it at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是衡量标准吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a metric?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他没扣下扳机就行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he didn't pull the trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩阻止了他 迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne stopped him, Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩出手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做我必须做的事 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do what I have to do, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,穴居人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cavemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是游牧民\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were all nomads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they all died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们人类进化成现代人 活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we evolved into this and we lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们不再漂泊才能建立文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilization starts when we stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们开始群居之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们不再随便杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we stop sending people away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,和流放人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the world and from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会这么告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm going to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会这么告诉所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm going to tell everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前有人经过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody came through here a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果见到他们 我们就撤回\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we see them, we hang back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安装好话筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up the mike,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯梢窃听\N{\fnArial\fs30}watch and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以前流放过人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've sent people away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很早的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,两男一女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维森是他们的头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davidson was their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常聪明 也很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart as hell, strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他们适合这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they'd work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜不适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他们进来 又不得不送走他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought them in and I had to see them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我 艾登 尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So me, Aiden, and Nicholas,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车把他们拉到很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}we drove them out far…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了他们能撑一天的水和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave them a day's worth of food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后扔下了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and left them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就那么配合吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just went?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他们的枪拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had their guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的枪都在我们这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had all the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能犯同样的错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make that kind of mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的事挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,障眼法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have more cover now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都以为你被抓到了 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them think you've been found out, that it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不想让他们知道我们还有枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you want to tell them we had more guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩阻止了你 她把你打晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne stopped you. She knocked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她依然站在我们这边 格伦也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with us. Glenn is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没告诉他们枪的事是以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell them about the guns just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to lie anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不想夺权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you don't want to take this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你不想说谎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't want to lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 鱼和熊掌不可兼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sunshine, you don't get both.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是野韭菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wild leeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋知道如何防蚊虫叮咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch knows about how to keep mosquitos off of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 托宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和她谈了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You met with her? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:20:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟大家谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna talk to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得在开会前尽量多找人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to everyone I can right up until.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要努力解决这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边见 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不想带枪吗 神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't want a gun, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想去散会儿步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want a quick walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有上帝的庇护就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word of god is the only protection I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说会议的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里就是了 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it is now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们他们必死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll die without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕要威胁他们其中一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have to threaten one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能要杀掉他们其中一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have to kill one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会的 - 有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't. - I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我就告诉他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.47,0:23:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须听得进去才算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell them so they can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们能否听得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.35,0:23:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把森林和道路都搜索了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked the forest, we checked the roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候就是会跟丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they slip away. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是每天都能碰到食品厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't come across something like this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们去拿食物 就得放弃找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do this now, it means we're giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们距家已经50英里了 该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home is 50 miles back. It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚也看到了 外面有坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it last night. There's bad people out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因此我们才要继续寻找那些好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we ought to keep looking for the good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.09,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的人 而且肯定会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more people and we'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.99,0:24:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但找到以后 还得供应他们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when we do, we'll need to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我还能看到这种车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't sure I'd ever see one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我也不喜欢放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I don't like giving up either,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.86,0:25:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个人穿着红色雨衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the guy is in a red poncho.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.41,0:25:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一英里之外就可以看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see him from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经追了很远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gone a lot of miles here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.86,0:25:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要能带回去一车的罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we come away with a trailer full of cans,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.90,0:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得也不虚此行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that's a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.57,0:26:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.45,0:26:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.65,0:26:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.57,0:26:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.88,0:27:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.24,0:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户能挡一阵子吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glass will hold for a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.24,0:27:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.17,0:27:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以让它们忽视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can make it so they can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.88,0:28:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几个小时 总会有东西路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a couple hours, something will come by,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.29,0:28:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会跟着走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll follow it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.13,0:28:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里应该有东西能挡住玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something in here we can use to block the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把座椅划开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can cut up these seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.99,0:28:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.44,0:28:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去看看塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to check on Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.67,0:28:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你治的她 你是医生 你得负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You treated her. You're a surgeon. You need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.35,0:28:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.58,0:29:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.97,0:29:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.87,0:29:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.24,0:29:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后谁会相信 我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then who would believe I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.85,0:29:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我不喜欢你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.97,0:29:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.59,0:29:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会相信你试图伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd believe you tried to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.27,0:29:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.07,0:29:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.95,0:29:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.17,0:29:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.51,0:29:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,按这样下去 你还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way this has played out, you have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.72,0:30:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子住在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.71,0:30:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个渺小的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a small, weak nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.25,0:30:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这世道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the world how it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就更怂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're even weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.46,0:30:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你路子走得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play your cards right,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.89,0:30:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你就不用死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you don't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.14,0:30:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃完把盘子洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want my dish back clean when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.79,0:30:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.33,0:30:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.81,0:31:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.65,0:31:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想来看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.11,0:32:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉他时被打的 不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it right when it was happening. It wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.49,0:32:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让别人看见我们聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}People shouldn't see us talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.06,0:32:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不后悔做了那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sorry I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.65,0:32:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我不得不做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.18,0:32:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别转身 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn around, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.15,0:32:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.43,0:32:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.85,0:33:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来是为了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came out here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.74,0:33:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离那个封闭的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}not feel all closed up back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便像现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.49,0:33:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是觉得要比\N{\fnArial\fs30}this still feels more like me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.60,0:33:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那些屋子里自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}than back in them houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.15,0:33:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺不正常的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty messed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在努力融入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.58,0:33:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.15,0:33:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.37,0:33:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我看见你和你的队伍在路上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I saw you with your group out there on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.57,0:33:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你一个人到了谷仓边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you went off on your own by the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雨来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.83,0:33:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你的人带到了安全地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you led your people to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.75,0:33:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.71,0:33:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我得把你们都带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I had to bring you people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.41,0:33:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本该继续寻找那个穿雨衣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have kept looking for that guy in the poncho.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.37,0:34:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.60,0:34:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.37,0:34:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它们引开 你逃到围栏那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lead them out. You make a break for the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.90,0:34:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.81,0:34:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.02,0:34:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是在问你意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.43,0:34:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也由不得你来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this ain't your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.54,0:34:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是任何人的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't nobody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.73,0:34:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我把这根烟抽完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me finish my smoke first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.68,0:34:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.67,0:34:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.81,0:34:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起到围栏那里 一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go for the fence. We do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 不管能不能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Whether we make it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.06,0:34:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.94,0:34:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.78,0:35:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.62,0:35:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.44,0:35:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.06,0:35:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.68,0:35:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.28,0:36:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亚伦 这是达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Aaron, this is Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.98,0:36:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.05,0:36:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.89,0:36:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为所有生命都是宝贵的 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all life is precious, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.59,0:36:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,设陷阱的那些人要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever set that trap, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我… 我们有个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have good news. We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里不远的地方有个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a community not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.53,0:36:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有围墙 有电 而且很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walls, electricity, it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你想加入我们 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I…If you'd like to come join us - I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.74,0:36:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要去一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm on my way somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.39,0:36:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我迷路了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, I'm lost, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.05,0:36:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我这里的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could tell me where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.13,0:37:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿再来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll …come by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.42,0:39:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.70,0:39:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡着了 坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asleep. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.35,0:40:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.01,0:40:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还让我醍醐灌顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She also cracked open my gourd.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.10,0:40:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解了我未曾理解的一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to considering implications I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.02,0:40:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会利用这次机会抒发己见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will remark about those at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.11,0:40:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们带到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.12,0:40:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是编了一个弥天大谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was craft a top- shelf lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.83,0:40:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一个孔武而英勇的人能够发挥才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}to which a person with strength and heroism could apply their talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.79,0:40:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你当时也需要这个契机\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bet was you needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.49,0:40:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的感谢和抱歉是等量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean both emphatically and in equal measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.73,0:41:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.46,0:41:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utterly and completely unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.30,0:41:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那倒是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.29,0:41:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.19,0:41:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我正想偷偷溜去参加会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, just wanted to sneak off to the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.49,0:41:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们晚些时候可以聊一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we could find some time to talk later?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.85,0:41:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊聊艾登？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Aiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些话想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some things I need to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.24,0:41:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道可以找谁说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not sure who I can say them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.91,0:41:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在真的没有一个可以交心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really have anyone here right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.49,0:42:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该明白我的意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.83,0:42:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.19,0:42:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.83,0:42:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把门带上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.65,0:42:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.28,0:43:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.82,0:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.46,0:43:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.27,0:44:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and me…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.49,0:44:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起计划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we worked it out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.07,0:44:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔从武器库拿了三把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol took three guns from the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.33,0:44:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一把 她手上也还有一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have one, she still has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.30,0:44:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对你说谎是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lied to you because.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.00,0:44:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会如何反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't sure how you'd take it,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.82,0:44:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.75,0:44:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会试图阻止你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd try to stop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.17,0:44:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确打了我的头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did hit me over the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.61,0:44:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为你好 不是为他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for you, not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.86,0:44:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前害怕你会劝我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid you'd talk me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.31,0:44:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有可能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.73,0:44:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.71,0:45:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不需要我的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.70,0:45:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你能想出办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you can find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.30,0:45:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以想出办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.86,0:45:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们想不出…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.18,0:45:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.06,0:45:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.15,0:45:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别主动惹事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't make something happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.71,0:45:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.10,0:46:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna find yourself in a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.47,0:46:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活又恢复原状了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it's like how it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.87,0:46:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你放弃了太多人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you let too much go along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.26,0:46:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会重回现实世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're gonna be back in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.21,0:46:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是现实世界 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the real world, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是一场噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, this is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.71,0:46:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nightmares end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.77,0:47:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.08,0:48:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我不知道该怎么办才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I don't… I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.91,0:48:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去理智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.75,0:48:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.55,0:48:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.13,0:48:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.25,0:48:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以再等等吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.59,0:48:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still people coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.48,0:48:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.46,0:48:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.72,0:48:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.76,0:48:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈谈最近发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to talk about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.05,0:48:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不谈打架的事 也不谈前因后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the fight. Not what precipitated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.73,0:48:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在处理那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈谈我们的一位治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to talk about one of our constables,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.68,0:49:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.22,0:49:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.00,0:49:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从武器库偷了一把手枪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he had a pistol he stole from the armory,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.39,0:49:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竟然拿枪对着自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how he pointed it at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.75,0:49:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要谈谈他之前说过的一些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're going to talk about what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.89,0:49:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望他此刻能在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping he'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.57,0:49:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说过他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said he's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.72,0:49:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.84,0:49:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也相信我们一定能好好解决这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure we can work this all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.18,0:49:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.44,0:50:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会不想死呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.41,0:50:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不配来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.94,0:50:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的所作所为 是无法抹除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did can never be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.51,0:50:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人没有选择权 但你做出的那些选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead don't choose, but the choices you made,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.45,0:50:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然牺牲了自己的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you sacrificed your own…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.47,0:50:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.32,0:50:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃当时被截肢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob was mutilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.62,0:50:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.16,0:50:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的罪孽 让他被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroyed because of your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.66,0:50:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.81,0:50:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥觉得那事与他无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother felt he was apart from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.89,0:50:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他其实脱不了干系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.88,0:50:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不配来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.18,0:50:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也不配 - 住嘴 住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't! - Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.91,0:51:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前在外面挣扎求生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after being out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.46,0:51:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又得接受另一种生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then not being how you were out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.04,0:51:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会把人逼疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can drive you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.03,0:51:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克只是希望家人能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick just wants his family to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.89,0:51:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望你们都能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants all of you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.18,0:51:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.91,0:51:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们以后的样子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is who you're gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.98,0:51:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们走运的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.22,0:52:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克·格兰姆斯一次又一次地救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes saved my life over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.68,0:52:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有很多很可怕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's terrifying people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.38,0:52:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从他们手中把我救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he rescued me from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.57,0:52:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.28,0:52:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.21,0:52:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要像他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need people like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.84,0:52:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道昨晚发生的事很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happened last night was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.77,0:52:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他一定深感抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure he's sorry for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但或许我们应该听进去他说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe we should listen to what he was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.46,0:53:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply put…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.96,0:53:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的屁事有很多 而你们屁也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a vast ocean of shit that you people don't know shit about.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.86,0:53:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克对那些可怕的屁事了如指掌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick knows every fine grain of said shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.53,0:53:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至远不止于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.48,0:53:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托不要 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please don't. - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.70,0:53:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 它们会听见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - They'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.76,0:53:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样重置需要更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take longer to reset it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.17,0:54:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.66,0:54:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.66,0:54:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.03,0:54:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲敬重瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father respected Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.76,0:54:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克也是一位父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is a father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.40,0:54:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一颗善良的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man with a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.81,0:54:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对做过的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}who feels the things he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.36,0:54:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,会感到愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things he has to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.19,0:54:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.05,0:54:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到这里前就在一起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who were together before this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们是何时相遇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter when we found each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.91,0:54:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在都是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.17,0:54:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全靠瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick started that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.04,0:54:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.85,0:54:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.03,0:54:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不想做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.52,0:54:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个社区 你们这些人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This community, you people…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.06,0:54:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大家庭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That family…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.20,0:55:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也想加入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be a part of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在其他人发言之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we hear from anyone else, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.98,0:55:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想本着透明的原则 分享一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to share something in the spirit of transparency.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.44,0:55:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利神父前天来找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Gabriel came to see me the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.63,0:55:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们不能信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said our new arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.59,0:55:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't be trusted,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.10,0:55:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they were dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把自己的利益放在社区之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they would put themselves before this community.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.95,0:55:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一天之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not one day later,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.63,0:55:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克就证实了加百利神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick seemed to demonstrate all the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.96,0:55:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Gabriel said.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.73,0:55:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望加百利今晚也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped Gabriel would be here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.29,0:55:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见他 迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see him here, Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.78,0:55:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你只是在口头转述他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just saying what someone said.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.64,0:55:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你录下他的话了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tape him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.35,0:55:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不在 - 瑞克也不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not here. - Neither is Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.87,0:56:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.69,0:56:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚是被你害死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah died because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.20,0:56:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你事实 教你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tried to tell you how it is, how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.13,0:56:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却想杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you try to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.90,0:57:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想保护我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to keep my family safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.07,0:57:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我都不知道这意味着什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? And I don't even know what that means anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.46,0:57:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果这意味着我们要流放…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if it means that we've got to get rid of…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.84,0:57:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时惊慌了 我惊慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared. I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.48,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不适应外面 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't belong out here. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.31,0:57:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我惊慌了 我惊慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared. I was just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.89,0:57:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.73,0:57:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不适应… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't belong… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.11,0:57:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不适应外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't belong out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.11,0:57:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.98,0:57:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.23,0:58:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.60,0:58:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.82,0:58:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该让她开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.50,0:58:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.98,0:58:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都因我而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all died because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.50,0:59:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.65,0:59:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,门口没有一个警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't a guard on the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.38,0:59:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,门大开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.93,0:59:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让加百利关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Gabriel to close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.06,0:59:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.84,0:59:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸不是我带进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.56,0:59:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它们自己进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got inside on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.27,0:59:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总会进来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always will…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.95,0:59:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是死人还是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead and the living,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.03,0:59:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.59,0:59:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the ones out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.79,0:59:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll hunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.45,0:59:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,会找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.06,0:59:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会试着利用我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll try to use us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.19,1:00:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会试着杀掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll try to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.44,1:00:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们会杀了它/他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.33,1:00:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能活下去 我会教你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll survive. I'll show you how.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.40,1:00:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinking…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.35,1:00:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀你们多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking how many of you do I have to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.43,1:00:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能救你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save your lives?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.25,1:01:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.40,1:01:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须做出改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.17,1:01:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对昨晚的话不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sorry for what I said last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.69,1:01:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我后悔的是没有早说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for not saying it sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not ready,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.17,1:01:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们必须准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.67,1:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就得准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.79,1:01:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气会到头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck runs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.67,1:01:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们的一员 你不是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not one of us. You're not one of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.54,1:01:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, you don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.97,1:01:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别靠近我 雷吉 - 皮特 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell away from me, Reg. Pete, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.54,1:01:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪开 - 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me. Reg. Reg.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.63,1:01:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪开 闪开 - 先别动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away. Get away! - not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.91,1:01:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮特 住手 皮特 - 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, Pete, stop. Pete… - Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no! - Oh, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:01:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都怪他 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is him! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.83,1:02:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都怪他 - 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is him! - Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.02,1:02:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my love. My love, my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.62,1:02:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, my love, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.53,1:02:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.67,1:02:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.70,1:02:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.40,1:02:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.66,1:02:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.87,1:02:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
